9. **Evidence limits and goal.** The replay confirms transitions 1–19 exactly. The implementation incorporates all reported initial-layout corrections, but unreported differences in transition 0 remain possible. UNDO and mouse behavior are not demonstrated and are modeled as unchanged. The likely goal is to transport blue-centered objects to pads before the status bar expires; no winning transition is shown.

